@startuml
participant PO
participant "FastAPI" as F
participant "StoryMCP" as S
participant "BusReview" as B
participant "EngReview" as E
participant "ArtifactMCP" as A
participant "Synthesis" as Y
participant "Facilitator" as T
database "CloudSQL" as C
PO -> F: list stories
F -> S: list_stories
S --> F: stories (JSON)
F --> PO: story list
PO -> F: select story
F -> S: get_story + epic/roadmap
S --> F: story details (JSON)
F -> A: save story artifact (idempotent, run ID)
par parallel fan-out (asyncio.gather)
F -> B: invoke (story artifact)
B --> F: review (Pydantic)
else
F -> E: invoke (story artifact)
E --> F: review (Pydantic)
end
F -> A: save both review artifacts (idempotent)
F -> C: persist reviewer runs (audit)
F -> Y: invoke (latest per perspective)
Y --> F: synthesis + conflicts
F -> A: save synthesis artifact
F -> C: create facilitator session
F -> C: append synthesis context
F -> T: invoke (open dialogue, present synthesis)
T --> F: opening reply + DelegationDecision
F -> C: persist turn + decision
F --> PO: reply + issues + session ID
@enduml
